{"id":"2126873bea8294ae","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-uniform-reflection.md","title":"统一反射原则","display":"df-uniform-reflection — 统一反射原则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-uniform-reflection","aliases":["91-df-uniform-reflection","91-df-URF"],"display":"df-uniform-reflection — 统一反射原则","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-uniform-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-uniform-reflection</span><span>91-df-URF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-reflection — 统一反射原则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-uniform-reflection-—-统一反射原则-$\\mathrm{URF}$\">df-uniform-reflection — 统一反射原则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URF}\">\\(\\mathrm{URF}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (递归公理化理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\)</span>\n(限制到公式类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的反射模式,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URF}\">\\(\\mathrm{URF}\\)</span> : 统一反射原则（Uniform Reflection Principle）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\">\\(\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\)</span>：把参数的数值代入其数字项后所得句子的编码</li>\n</ul>\n<p>统一反射原则的含义：\n统一反射逐点断言：对每个参数元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\">\\(\\vec n\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\bar{\\vec n})\">\\(\\varphi(\\bar{\\vec n})\\)</span>，则该实例成立。</p>\n<p>统一反射 vs 局部反射 vs 全局反射：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>量词位置</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>局部反射</td>\n<td>无量词（对每个特定<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>）</td>\n<td>单个句子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一反射</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\)</span> 统摄整个逐点蕴涵</td>\n<td>所有数字实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真理化全局反射</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall z(\\mathrm{Sent}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(z)\\to T(z))\">\\(\\forall z(\\mathrm{Sent}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(z)\\to T(z))\\)</span></td>\n<td>所有句子代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>展开引用的定义后，一个单变量实例严格写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(x)\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(x)\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}\\)</span> 是数码代入编码的对象语言表示；这避免\n把元层记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot x)\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot x)\\urcorner\\)</span> 直接当作对象语言项。</p>\n<p>统一反射的强度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对常见公式类与背景理论，统一反射通常严格强于相应局部反射模式</li>\n<li>统一反射可证明更多算术定理</li>\n<li>统一反射不需要真理谓词；真理谓词用于把所有句子代码的声性压缩成全局反射单句</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-uniform-reflection-—-统一反射原则-$\\mathrm{URF}$","text":"df-uniform-reflection — 统一反射原则 $\\mathrm{URF}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)$\n(限制到公式类 $\\mathcal C$ 的反射模式,\nsee [[91-df-reflection-principle]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{URF}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URF}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\bar{\\vec n})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall z(\\mathrm{Sent}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(z)\\to T(z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},x)\n\\right)\n\\to\\varphi(x)\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot x)\\urcorner","display":false}],"bytes":2027,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-uniform-reflection]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-uniform-reflection]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-